{"title":"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 2","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><dl><dd><i>The following problem is from the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">1998 CEMC Cayley #2</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Fermat_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Fermat Problems (page does not exist)\">1998 CEMC Fermat #2</a>, so those problems redirect to this page.</i></dd></dl>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The pie chart shows a percentage breakdown of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> votes in a student election. How many votes did Sue receive?\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><i>An image is supposed to go here.  You can help us out by creating one and <span class=\"plainlinks\"><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit\">editing it in</a></span>.  Thanks.</i>\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/b/4/db42d615d89167dca6c5e29ab08d0601136d411d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\text{ (A) }\\ 550 \\qquad\\text{ (B) }\\ 350 \\qquad\\text{ (C) }\\ 330 \\qquad\\text{ (D) }\\ 450 \\qquad\\text{ (E) }\\ 935$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"479\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> votes in total, Jane got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/1/5/5159e5e90b9539a2fde6e116bc4a1ad34606ec48.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45\\% \\times 1000 = 450$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"17\" /> votes and Jim got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/a/d/9ad513c489934902b8dc3358c8de6453cb361750.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\% \\times 1000 = 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"145\" height=\"17\" /> votes. Thus, Jane and Jim got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/c/26c03fd3f278497dd16870a48735349be8132ec5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$450 + 200 = 650$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"130\" height=\"15\" /> votes in total, so Sue got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/8/a0862cb1d33b82f8dc6565c40f98ad8ebcc59d08.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000 - 650 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 350}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"185\" height=\"30\" /> votes.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Jane and Jim got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/d/8/2d817598e77534c6d5213e3c5dd6e79e04657d28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$45\\% + 20\\% = 65\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"148\" height=\"17\" /> of the votes in total, so Sue got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/d/2bdcb37348ac4dbf7249c2c91bc450105623dccc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$100\\% - 65\\% = 35\\%$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"157\" height=\"17\" /> of the votes.\n</p><p>Since there were <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/e/6ee927e1332358c96c62c277441c907c4f51057f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$1000$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"38\" height=\"14\" /> votes in total, Sue got <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/c/79c0d047bd8e43bdf2618b8b73f337abc69e9d01.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$35\\% \\times 1000 = \\boxed {\\textbf {(B) } 350}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"191\" height=\"30\" /> votes.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley\">1998 CEMC Cayley</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems (page does not exist)\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Answer_Key&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Answer Key (page does not exist)\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://cemc.math.uwaterloo.ca/contests/past_contests.html\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">Problem 1</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">Problem 3</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 5 (page does not exist)\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_7&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 7 (page does not exist)\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_8&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 8 (page does not exist)\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_9&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 9 (page does not exist)\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_12&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"1998 CEMC Cayley Problems/Problem 12 (page does not exist)\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1998_CEMC_Cayley_Problems/Problem_13&amp;action=edit&amp;red